            "libraryTitle": "Statements",
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.Summary 1.10",
              "params": {
                "intro": "<p>In the following list of ten questions, nine of them are meant to guide you through an engagement process. Can you identify the question that does not belong in this list?</p>\n",
                "summaries": [
                  {
                    "subContentId": "bd0502e3-d39a-41ff-904b-e946a6a0cd76",
                    "summary": [
                      "<p>How will you make sure you avoid using technology?</p>\n",
                      "<p>Have you articulated the project’s goals?</p>\n",
                      "<p>Have you identified the right participants?</p>\n",
                      "<p>Can you reach the participants you identified?</p>\n",
                      "<p>Who is the right owner who will take responsibility for completing the project?</p>\n",
                      "<p>Have you included incentives for participation?</p>\n",
                      "<p>Have you defined the tasks?</p>\n",
                      "<p>How will you use responses from the engagement to take action?</p>\n",
                      "<p>Have you established the “workflow” from end to beginning?</p>\n",
                      "<p>How will you use what the group creates?</p>\n"
                    ],
                    "tip": ""
                  }
                ],
